  "corrections": [
    "Do not use repeated act as reconciliation: delivery and operation receipt are not atomic.",
    "Stable run/channel identity and cancellation generations preserve native Session; actual audience changes retire epoch.",
    "Retain observation transport at terminal; same-run approved reconnect can observe old operations.",
    "Final synchronous gate follows asynchronous preflight before act.",
    "Bounded pending inputs stop explicitly instead of dropping oldest or selecting only a tail.",
    "Runtime pause fixture waits for both blocked native steps rather than merely entered requests."
